</div>

<main>

  <!-- ===================== HOME VIEW ===================== -->
  <section id="view-home" class="view active">
    <div class="hero">
      <img class="hero-photo" id="hero-photo" src="images/hero.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true"
        onerror="this.style.display='none'; document.getElementById('hero-photo-missing').style.display='block';">
      <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div id="hero-photo-missing" style="display:none; position:absolute; top:16px; left:16px; z-index:5; background:#b8452e; color:#fff; font-size:11px; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:3px;">
        images/hero.jpg not found — check it's in the images folder next to this HTML file
      </div>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="eyebrow" data-i18n="hero_eyebrow">A travel guide built on real data</div>
        <h1 data-i18n="hero_h1">The natural side of Kyrgyzstan — mapped accurately, planned honestly</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub" data-i18n="hero_sub">Lakes, canyons, sacred peaks and Silk Road ruins, each with real coordinates, verified elevation, and season-by-season access notes — not just vague promises.</p>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <button class="btn primary lg" id="hero-cta-map" data-i18n="hero_cta_map">Explore the map</button>
          <button class="btn lg" id="hero-cta-tours" data-i18n="hero_cta_tours">Browse tours</button>
          <button class="btn lg" id="hero-cta-plan" data-i18n="hero_cta_plan">Build a trip</button>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stats" id="hero-stats"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-credit">Photo: Tian Shan mountains — <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tian_Shan_mountains,_Kyrgyzstan_(30069071195).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:inherit;">Wikimedia Commons</a></div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
      <div class="eyebrow" data-i18n="why_eyebrow">Why this guide</div>
      <h1 class="page-h1-sm" data-i18n="why_h1">Built to be actually useful while you're planning</h1>
      <div class="why-grid">
        <div class="why-card">
          <div class="why-num">01</div>
          <h3 data-i18n="why1_h">Real coordinates, not guesses</h3>
          <p data-i18n="why1_p">Every marker on the map is pinned from verified geographic data — what you see is what you'll actually find when you get there.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <div class="why-num">02</div>
          <h3 data-i18n="why2_h">Season-aware, not generic</h3>
          <p data-i18n="why2_p">A stunning alpine lake is useless information in December. Every entry tells you exactly when it's actually reachable.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-card">
          <div class="why-num">03</div>
          <h3 data-i18n="why3_h">A real route, not a wishlist</h3>
          <p data-i18n="why3_p">Pick your days and interests and get a sensible west-to-east itinerary built from the same data — not a random list.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page page-tight">
      <div class="eyebrow" data-i18n="cat_eyebrow">Browse by category</div>
      <h1 class="page-h1-sm" data-i18n="cat_h1">What kind of trip is it?</h1>
      <div class="cat-grid" id="cat-grid"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="page page-tight">
      <div class="eyebrow" data-i18n="ht_eyebrow">Ready-made routes</div>
      <h1 class="page-h1-sm" data-i18n="ht_h1">Popular tours</h1>
      <div class="home-tours" id="home-tours"></div>
      <button class="btn" id="see-tours-btn" style="margin-top:20px;" data-i18n="see_tours">See all tours →</button>
    </div>

    <div class="page page-tight">
      <div class="eyebrow" data-i18n="feat_eyebrow">A few places to start</div>
